                                                "sense_id": "69165a5c-d540-3c77-9a31-18d409d9c753",
                                                "text": "The Caliga was a military Shoe, with a very thick Sole, tied above the instep with leather Thongs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6c2d3db-bac2-3e9b-a53d-ee4ee74242b8",
